    <bpmn:process id="W_W5493" name="W5493. B2B / Trade-Project Demand Induction into the Consensus Plan" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: B2B/trade-project pipeline update (links to VS-11/VS-107/VS-182); monthly consensus cycle
Frequency: Monthly + per major project win
Volume: Trade-pro/B2B segment: large construction projects, government/infrastructure, key-account contracts, indent/bulk orders (links to VS-107/VS-182) — lumpy, project-driven demand distinct from steady-state retail
Owner: S&amp;OP/IBP Lead (Supply Chain &amp; Logistics)
Participants: Trade/B2B Sales (links to VS-11/VS-107), Demand Planning, Merchandising (links to VS-01), Supply Planning, Sourcing/Import (links to VS-122/VS-182), Finance (links to VS-105/VS-181), Store Ops/DC (links to VS-07/VS-04), Project/Indent (links to VS-182)
Source: workflow W5493 — B2B / Trade-Project Demand Induction into the Consensus Plan</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5493_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5493_Lane1" name="Trade">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5493_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5493_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5493_Lane2" name="S&amp;OP">
