        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5493_Start4" name="B2B/trade-project pipeline update (links to VS-11/VS-107/VS-182); monthly consensus cycle">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5493_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5493_Task5" name="Trade/B2B Sales provide the qualified project pipeline (project, SKU/BOM…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Trade/B2B Sales provide the qualified project pipeline (project, SKU/BOM, volume, required-by date, win-probability, indent/special-order flags links to VS-182/VS-107); Demand Planning translate it into a project-demand overlay on the statistical baseline, kept separate from steady-state so lumpy demand does not distort replenishment
Responsible (R): Trade / Demand Planning
Accountable (A): S&amp;OP/IBP Lead
Duration: Monthly + per win</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5493_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5493_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5493_Task6" name="S&amp;OP/IBP/Supply reconcile project demand against supply constraints (import…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: S&amp;OP/IBP/Supply reconcile project demand against supply constraints (import lead 45–90 days links to VS-122, vendor capacity, DC staging links to VS-77/VS-04, jobsite delivery links to VS-74), decide make-to-stock vs make/order-to-order vs indent, and reserve capacity/material for high-probability projects
Responsible (R): S&amp;OP/IBP / Supply / Sourcing
Accountable (A): S&amp;OP/IBP Lead
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5493_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5493_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5493_Task7" name="S&amp;OP/IBP fold confirmed project demand into the constrained consensus plan…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: S&amp;OP/IBP fold confirmed project demand into the constrained consensus plan (links to W3912/W3920), align financing (project escrow/lien links to VS-181, SCF links to VS-105), and track project-demand forecast accuracy separately (links to W3911) so project phasing errors are visible
Responsible (R): S&amp;OP/IBP / Finance / Demand Planning
Accountable (A): S&amp;OP/IBP Lead
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5493_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5493_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5493_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
