        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-613 (ensure controlled execution — Calamity, Seasonality &amp; Philippine-Retail Demand–Supply Dynamics (PA-127.4).) | - operational: project-demand kept as a separate overlay on the baseline; operational: probability-weighted reservation with separate forecast-accuracy tracking; operational: import-lead reconciliation against required-by dates
Owner: S&amp;OP/IBP Lead (Supply Chain &amp; Logistics)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
