    <bpmn:process id="W_W5496" name="W5496. Government-Mandated Price Events and Calamity Price-Freeze S&amp;OP Response" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: DTI/RA 7581 Price-Act calamity price-freeze declaration; election-period mandated SRP; DTI basic-goods mandate; regulatory price event (links to VS-117/VS-22/VS-76)
Frequency: On mandate + annual election-cycle prep
Volume: Calamity price-freezes (region-wide, 60-day typical per RA 7581); election-period SRPs; DTI basic-goods SRP coverage — each overrides the commercial price/promo plan on demand
Owner: S&amp;OP/IBP Lead (Supply Chain &amp; Logistics)
Participants: Merchandising/Pricing (links to VS-01.2/VS-118), S&amp;OP/IBP, Supply Planning, Marketing/Promo (links to VS-14/VS-58), Store Ops (links to VS-07), Legal/Regulatory (links to VS-22/VS-76/VS-117), Finance (links to VS-101), Demand Planning
Source: workflow W5496 — Government-Mandated Price Events and Calamity Price-Freeze S&amp;OP Response</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5496_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5496_Lane1" name="Legal">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5496_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5496_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5496_Lane2" name="S&amp;OP">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5496_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5496_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5496_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5496_Start4" name="DTI/RA 7581 Price-Act calamity price-freeze declaration; election-period mandated SRP…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5496_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5496_Task5" name="On a price-freeze/SRP mandate, Legal/Regulatory confirm scope (SKUs, regions…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: On a price-freeze/SRP mandate, Legal/Regulatory confirm scope (SKUs, regions, duration, price ceiling per RA 7581/DTI — links to VS-117/VS-22), and S&amp;OP/IBP/Merchandising-Pricing assess the margin and demand impact: frozen SKUs&#x27; margin compression, the demand spike a freeze/calamity typically triggers, and the conflict with any active promo (links to VS-14/VS-58)
Responsible (R): Legal / S&amp;OP/IBP / Pricing
Accountable (A): S&amp;OP/IBP Lead
Duration: 4–8 hrs per mandate</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5496_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5496_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5496_Task6" name="S&amp;OP/IBP adjust the consensus plan: pull forward / re-phase demand for frozen…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: S&amp;OP/IBP adjust the consensus plan: pull forward / re-phase demand for frozen SKUs, suspend/re-price conflicting promos, align the typhoon pre-positioning (links to W5489) so pre-positioned calamity stock is sold at the frozen price, and quantify the margin/demand gap for exec S&amp;OP (links to W3912/W3919)
Responsible (R): S&amp;OP/IBP / Merchandising / Supply
Accountable (A): S&amp;OP/IBP Lead
Duration: Per mandate</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5496_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5496_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5496_Task7" name="S&amp;OP/IBP/Store Ops execute the frozen-price replenishment (no margin-driven…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: S&amp;OP/IBP/Store Ops execute the frozen-price replenishment (no margin-driven stockout, no price-gouging — the freeze forbids it), monitor compliance (price-check links to VS-118/W107), and run the post-freeze demand/margin reconciliation and promo re-activation
Responsible (R): S&amp;OP/IBP / Store Ops / Pricing
Accountable (A): S&amp;OP/IBP Lead
Duration: Per mandate + post-freeze</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5496_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5496_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5496_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5496_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-72 (ensure S&amp;OP consensus &amp; financial reconciliation.) | - operational: RA 7581 price-freeze scope/skus/regions/duration confirmed by Legal before execution; operational: price-freeze master + DTI price-check compliance (VS-118/W107); operational: promo-conflict auto-suspension
Owner: S&amp;OP/IBP Lead (Supply Chain &amp; Logistics)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W5496_Assoc10" sourceRef="W5496_Annotation9" targetRef="W5496_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W5496_Flow11" sourceRef="W5496_Start4" targetRef="W5496_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W5496_Flow12" sourceRef="W5496_Task5" targetRef="W5496_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W5496_Flow13" sourceRef="W5496_Task6" targetRef="W5496_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W5496_Flow14" sourceRef="W5496_Task7" targetRef="W5496_End8" />
    </bpmn:process>
